---

## Conclusion

This project demonstrates a complete Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) workflow. By combining semantic retrieval with a language model, the system generates accurate, context-based answers from custom documents while minimizing hallucinations. The implementation serves as a strong foundation for building document-based chatbots, question-answering systems, and knowledge assistants.
